      "rationale": "Andũ aingĩ a taũri metĩkĩrĩaga: mucĩ ũcio ũringĩtwo (ASV\/KJV) kana nĩ gĩtumbi kĩu kĩarĩ gĩkĩringĩrĩra (BSB); YLT nĩyo ĩrĩkĩte mwandĩko kuuma ũrĩa wagwetio"
